layoutFor is operation
layoutFor purpose "The va_list layout this system has: 3 on Windows, 1 on x86_64 Linux, 2 on AArch64 Linux"
layoutFor invariant none
layoutFor typeParameter none
layoutFor input onLinux Bool copied
layoutFor input onArm Bool copied
layoutFor output Int64
layoutFor outputOwnedBy none
layoutFor raises none
layoutFor effect none
layoutFor uses none
layoutFor memoryHeap false
layoutFor async false
layoutFor maxRecursion none
layoutFor label begin loopKind none
layoutFor label begin within none
layoutFor label windows loopKind none
layoutFor label windows within none
layoutFor label linux loopKind none
layoutFor label linux within none
layoutFor label arm loopKind none
layoutFor label arm within none
layoutFor label sysv loopKind none
layoutFor label sysv within none
layoutFor let windowsLayout Int64 3 immutable
layoutFor let sysvLayout Int64 1 immutable
layoutFor let armLayout Int64 2 immutable
layoutFor at begin branch if onLinux goto linux else goto windows
layoutFor at windows return ok windowsLayout
layoutFor at linux branch if onArm goto arm else goto sysv
layoutFor at arm return ok armLayout
layoutFor at sysv return ok sysvLayout
